# SkullbonezCore render validation suite - single process
# Run with: SKULLBONEZ_CORE.exe --suite SkullbonezData/scenes/render_tests.suite
#
# Scene order:
#   1. water_ball_test - render regression screenshot
#   2. solver_smoke    - render regression screenshot (300 generated balls, deterministic)
#
# Performance validation is intentionally separate:
#   SKULLBONEZ_CORE.exe --vsync off --fixed-step --scene SkullbonezData/scenes/perf_test.scene
SkullbonezData/scenes/water_ball_test.scene
SkullbonezData/scenes/solver_smoke.scene
